name = "Lucid: King of Legend (Second Job Change)"
description = "There's a story about Lucid where his sword was shattered after he drove it in the ground to signify the reunion of the Seven Knights. You should talk to Leonard, whose family has been charged with keeping the sword fragments, to see if you can find the truth."
